{"id":"n66071-2-8","stage":3,"title":"싸이다 · 被围住","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66071-2-8-1","ko":"저 앞에 있는 봉우리는 어느 산이야?","zh":"前面那个山峰是哪座山啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"봉우리는","meaning":"山峰","explanation":"봉우리：山峰；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"봉우리","audio":"/audio/24f977533c4378598605.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59339","senseId":"1","lemma":"봉우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봉우리는","audio":"/audio/98fb974d1a07f316772b.mp3"}},{"text":"어느","meaning":"哪，哪个","explanation":"어느：哪，哪个","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"3","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}},{"text":"산이야?","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산이야","audio":"/audio/1e7c950d478e63b95306.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"24f977533c437859","term":"봉우리","zh":"山峰","audio":"/audio/24f977533c4378598605.mp3","entryId":"59339","definition":"山上最高耸的部分。","pronunciation":["봉우리"]},{"id":"76e7139b030308e7","term":"어느","zh":"哪，哪个","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3","entryId":"62822","definition":"不管任何人或物。","pronunciation":["어느"]},{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]}],"audio":"/audio/8de6f4c35f926b7e7662.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66071-2-8-2","ko":"응? 안개에 싸여서 잘 안 보여.","zh":"嗯？被雾气笼罩着，看不太清楚。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응?","meaning":"什么，啊","explanation":"응：什么，啊","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"3","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"안개에","meaning":"雾，雾气","explanation":"안개：雾，雾气；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"안개","audio":"/audio/b70164aa8123e15aa7fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14777","senseId":"1","lemma":"안개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안개에","audio":"/audio/15abf6f18e7c78100dae.mp3"}},{"text":"싸여서","meaning":"被围住，被遮蔽，被陷入","explanation":"싸이다：被围住，被遮蔽，被陷入；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"싸이다","audio":"/audio/8b622b74cc2c39a6e0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66071","senseId":"2","lemma":"싸이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸여서","audio":"/audio/4272a1b1fd4b8b17a631.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"보여.","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보여","audio":"/audio/f30cd240679cd06f7fad.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"什么，啊","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于再次询问对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"b70164aa8123e15a","term":"안개","zh":"雾，雾气","audio":"/audio/b70164aa8123e15aa7fa.mp3","entryId":"14777","definition":"接近地面的水蒸气，遇冷凝结后飘浮在空气中的小水点。","pronunciation":["안ː개"]},{"id":"8b622b74cc2c39a6","term":"싸이다","zh":"被围住，被遮蔽，被陷入","audio":"/audio/8b622b74cc2c39a6e0a6.mp3","entryId":"66071","definition":"四周被挡住或遮住。","pronunciation":["싸이다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"